{"version":1,"content":"<p>印度數字信任與網絡安全公司eMudhra於10月22日宣佈，公司董事會已決定主動退出全球SSL/TLS證書業務。未來，公司將進一步聚焦核心企業解決方案以及除SSL/TLS之外的數字信任服務。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1583474.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T05:43:51.929093+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":100,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T05:17:35+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T05:38:06.572122+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T05:38:06.572122+00:00","content_hash":"c7918f4f335a9abcb8435fd5245aaa2bc206e61f64abc1ca4c0f43c6b00bc11d","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}